+  <!-- Collision sensing for the whole robot, not just the base. The base shell (Tibia) alone
+       missed side-on bumps: in the standing pose the hands reach 0.38 m from the centre line and
+       the forearms 0.23 m, so the arms touch a table edge or couch back before the base does.
+       The torso is fixed-jointed to base_link, so its collision is the lumped one. -->
+  <xacro:macro name="ign_base_contact" params="
