- DiffDrive acceleration limits 0.34 m/s^2 and 0.80 rad/s^2, from the 10-90% rise of a
  0.3 m/s step (0.64/0.80 s) and a 0.9 rad/s spin (0.78/1.06 s). The sim had none and
