- Standing pose from the robot's StandInit: right elbow roll 0.511 (was 0.17, not the
  mirror of the left), shoulder pitch 1.575/1.583 (was 1.77), and the rest of the arms,
  hips and knee to the measured values. Hands and fingers unchanged.
